Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:56.74,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:59.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:04.67,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:11.17,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:16.89,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:23.04,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.27,0:02:27.54,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.21,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.98,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:41.35,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}If I reach out, I can stay in this night
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:46.60,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:50.42,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}The tip of the blade held high
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:52.92,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}And all the feelings held inside
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:03:00.37,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur7.5}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.07,0:01:56.74,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.74,0:01:59.96,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.96,0:02:04.67,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur0.75}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.96,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.96,0:02:11.17,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.17,0:02:16.89,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.89,0:02:23.04,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur0.75}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.27,0:02:27.54,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.21,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur0.75}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.98,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur0.75}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.74,0:02:41.35,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur0.75}If I reach out, I can stay in this night
